WEBVTT

00:01:57.840 --> 00:02:00.120
Hey Joe, I'm getting scared.

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:03.480
Unlike the guys in the holding cell, I can't predict what these guys will do.

00:02:03.480 --> 00:02:06.340
What's wrong, Fatty? Why are you sweating?

00:02:06.340 --> 00:02:10.990
Is a little bit of farm work that scary? What's up?

00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:12.750
Nothing, I...

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:14.870
Then come sit over here.

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:20.500
Look at the guy next to you. Try to be more like him.

00:02:21.010 --> 00:02:23.500
He looks like he's just enjoying the end of spring.

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:27.550
Don't you mean the end of the world?

00:02:28.470 --> 00:02:33.660
That's true. We can't guarantee you'll make it to the bus back.

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:36.890
Getting there is easy. It's getting back that's scary.

00:02:38.020 --> 00:02:40.520
Shut up. Keep it down, be quiet.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:42.520
What did you say!?

00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:44.010
Wanna fight?

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:45.510
Bring it on.

00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:47.530
Damn...

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:51.150
I don't know what you guys are thinking.

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:54.640
I won't have time to play with you children once we get to the farm,

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:58.050
but we could have a little fight right now, come on!

00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:01.550
You have a big mouth for a new guy.

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:04.290
Why is someone so young in such a rush to die?

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:05.620
Tunnel.

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:10.630
Joe.

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:18.640
You're going too far. Those guys were talking about killing you last night.

00:03:19.180 --> 00:03:20.140
Killing me?

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:25.150
Th-They were talking about how to get rid of you at the farm without anyone noticing.

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:30.220
It's true. What if these guys are really keen on taking people out?

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:32.670
I'm not going to die in a place like this.

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:34.820
I'll get out of here soon.

00:03:34.820 --> 00:03:39.830
I thought so... You have an escape plan. I'll help you.

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:43.320
I don't like working with others.

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:45.840
Just enjoy the sights and don't get in the way.

00:03:47.380 --> 00:03:49.840
It's not that easy.

00:03:53.770 --> 00:03:55.360
Heave-ho.

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:56.590
There.

00:04:02.310 --> 00:04:03.350
Damn it.

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.360
Damn it.

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:06.360
<i>Here we go.</i>

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:07.840
Come on.

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:10.300
Damn it.

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:12.040
Damn it.

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:17.830
Son of a bitch!

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:20.840
Joe...

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:26.060
There's no point in rushing, just wait for a good chance.

00:04:26.060 --> 00:04:31.720
Just calm down. It'll just make things worse if you complain about the work.{retime to end at next wave chunk "mikomi wa nai de" or w/e}

00:04:31.720 --> 00:04:33.780
Try not to draw attention to yourself,{retime "motto ochitsuite...}

00:04:34.390 --> 00:04:35.090
okay?

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:39.270
If you keep hanging around me, I'll get even more attention!

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:40.330
Go away!

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:43.270
We're surrounded by barbed wire.

00:04:46.990 --> 00:04:48.610
This place is killing me.

00:04:53.800 --> 00:04:55.490
Isn't there anything I can do?

00:05:00.280 --> 00:05:01.700
Anything.

00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:30.620
God damn it.

00:05:43.790 --> 00:05:48.460
Hey, new guy, what are you doing standing in the corner?

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:51.840
I see. You bastard, you're trying to escape, aren't you?

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:55.400
You think it's that easy, don't you?

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:59.770
{Singing}No way, no way, no way, no way...

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:08.380
It's not going to turn out how you want it to...

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:10.900
We still have lots of games to play with you.

00:06:10.900 --> 00:06:13.230
The games are really interesting.

00:06:13.730 --> 00:06:15.470
You bastard!

00:06:17.490 --> 00:06:21.650
I'll kill you for stepping on my face. I'll kill you.

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:28.430
Hey, that's dangerous. What do you guys think you're doing?

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:31.380
S-Stop, Yabuki! Calm down. Yabuki-kun, calm down!

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:32.880
Shut up! Don't say a word!

00:06:36.460 --> 00:06:38.050
I should crack your skull.

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:42.800
Help, help... Save me. Help.

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:44.210
Let go! Let go of him.

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:02.580
There's no hope for that guy. We need to be extra careful about him.

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:06.550
Don't let your guard down. Seems like he'll try to escape.

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:12.400
Hey, everybody, what are you doing? You have work to do. Work, work!

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:16.810
That's not true, you liar! You idiot!

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:19.030
Give us our money back, you fraud!

00:07:19.030 --> 00:07:22.090
Someone help me!

00:07:22.090 --> 00:07:24.130
Wait up. Get back here!

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:28.340
Give us our money back, you fake. Give it back! Give it back!

00:07:28.350 --> 00:07:29.320
Someone... Someone!

00:07:29.320 --> 00:07:30.870
Someone... Someone!

00:07:30.870 --> 00:07:32.680
Help me.

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:34.200
Danpei-san, help me.

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:35.050
<i>What's going on here?</i>

00:07:35.670 --> 00:07:39.520
They asked me when Yabuki Joe would be back, so I told them,

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:42.110
then they got mad.

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:47.570
Of course! We asked you when Joe would be back. Say it again in front of Danpei.

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:54.340
What do you mean "three days"? We know he won't be back for at least a year and a month.

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:58.130
You just made it up because we're children!

00:07:58.130 --> 00:07:59.700
Fortune-teller,

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:01.590
did you say that?

00:08:01.590 --> 00:08:03.280
W-Well...

00:08:03.280 --> 00:08:09.720
He's aggressive... I don't think Joe will put up with that place for a whole year.

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:17.020
You fraud. You're making money off of children's worries. I don't care what they do to you.

00:08:17.020 --> 00:08:19.230
I knew you were a fake. I'll beat you up.

00:08:19.230 --> 00:08:21.730
I'll return the money. I'll return it. Forgive me.

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:27.080
But it's Joe... He might escape.

00:08:27.660 --> 00:08:36.000
Oh, really? Understood. That's all I wanted to ask. Sorry to bother you.

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:41.210
Yabuki-kun is working very hard.

00:08:41.210 --> 00:08:43.400
R-Really?

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:47.850
Thank you so much. You've really helped me. Sorry for the trouble.

00:08:48.660 --> 00:08:50.890
I guess you were really worried about him.

00:08:51.820 --> 00:08:55.210
I thought he was going to try to escape.

00:08:55.210 --> 00:08:57.900
It's okay, he's not trying to get out.

00:08:58.900 --> 00:09:01.730
Now I know that, I can sleep at night.

00:09:01.730 --> 00:09:03.010
Danpei-san,

00:09:03.010 --> 00:09:05.740
I need to talk to you about something.

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:07.580
What's that?

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:14.750
I'm certain that, if Yabuki-kun wants to be a boxer, he won't try to escape.

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:18.260
You'll see. He won't run away.

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:30.340
Hey guys, there's a place I want you to see.

00:09:30.930 --> 00:09:33.930
Hey, you again? You need more manure?

00:09:33.930 --> 00:09:36.770
We came to pick some up for the field.

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:39.430
It's for a new guy. We'd prefer fresh manure.

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:40.650
That's right.

00:09:42.150 --> 00:09:46.110
Anyway, give us some. It won't take long.

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:50.250
Whatever, take your time. We'll catch up and watch.

00:09:50.910 --> 00:09:54.410
I'll be waiting. It sounds like fun.

00:09:55.100 --> 00:09:58.640
I don't know what you're doing, but it sounds like fun.

00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:04.380
Come on, Nishi, stop daydreaming. Let's go. Hurry up, okay?

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:07.410
I don't want to keep those guys waiting.

00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:10.590
Which way is it to the pig pens? Let's go quickly.

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:13.560
Don't get scared and faint or anything.

00:10:19.560 --> 00:10:21.020
Okay?

00:10:23.170 --> 00:10:24.440
Rikiishi-san is coming.

00:10:25.190 --> 00:10:26.230
Rikiishi?

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:28.200
Who?

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:54.290
Thank you for coming, Rikiishi-san.

00:10:55.310 --> 00:10:56.760
Which one is Yabuki Joe?

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:57.690
Yabuki?

00:10:57.690 --> 00:11:02.280
That one. Rikiishi-san is calling for you. Get over here.

00:11:02.280 --> 00:11:03.960
Hurry it up.

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:08.710
I'm Yabuki Joe. If you want something, hurry up and say it.

00:11:08.710 --> 00:11:09.930
Idiot!

00:11:10.590 --> 00:11:12.770
You got a postcard.

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:14.280
A postcard for me?

00:11:16.270 --> 00:11:17.290
Hand it over.

00:11:24.110 --> 00:11:25.630
Hey, what are you doing?

00:11:26.960 --> 00:11:30.090
I brought you a postcard. Where's my "thank you"?

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:32.090
What a rude postman.

00:11:34.140 --> 00:11:36.140
You're such a stubborn kid.

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:42.900
{laughing}See you later.

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:46.000
Joe, are you okay?

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:47.860
Damn that asshole.

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:49.540
Who's the postcard from?

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:52.060
Shiraki Yoko.

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:55.870
What is that rich airhead thinking?

00:11:56.370 --> 00:11:58.200
I see.

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:00.200
A masterpiece to ease my heart.

00:12:00.200 --> 00:12:03.540
Are you trying to say I should look at this if I need to calm down?

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:05.500
You think I'm stupid?

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:07.190
I don't have time for your games.

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:09.760
Let's go.

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:20.450
He's coming.

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:27.570
This is gonna be good.

00:12:41.040 --> 00:12:44.020
What do you think? Smells nice, right?

00:12:44.670 --> 00:12:48.040
O-Oh man, that stinks so much.

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:53.110
Well, it can't be helped seeing as this place is mostly mixed up piss and shit.

00:12:53.110 --> 00:12:55.270
This is the best manure for vegetables.

00:12:55.270 --> 00:12:58.020
We have to scoop this up?

00:12:58.020 --> 00:13:00.330
Well, yeah, that's about right.

00:13:00.330 --> 00:13:02.290
So how should we collect it?

00:13:02.290 --> 00:13:06.310
How about the new guys help us out? How does that sound?

00:13:06.310 --> 00:13:07.750
W-What should I do?

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:12.030
What? Don't worry, it's not a big deal. Here you go.

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:15.450
Don't be shy, up you go.

00:13:15.450 --> 00:13:17.530
W-What? What are you doing?

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:20.080
Throw 'em over.

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:20.860
What are you doing?

00:13:21.380 --> 00:13:23.290
L-Let go. Let go of me, damn it!

00:13:23.290 --> 00:13:24.110
There!

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:28.470
Bring the bucket!

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:27.690
<i>It stinks!</i>

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:31.510
Here you go. Once more.

00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:36.670
Come on, get the manure into the buckets.

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:40.040
We don't have shovels, so scoop it up with your hands.

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:41.780
Hands? You expect us to use our hands?

00:13:41.780 --> 00:13:44.520
Of course, with your hands. Do it for us, please.

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:48.520
Bullshit. I'm trying to stay calm but you've gone too far.

00:13:51.780 --> 00:13:52.480
That's dangerous.

00:13:54.340 --> 00:13:56.730
You still refusing to do it?

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:58.530
Damn it.

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:58.530
<i>Joe.</i>

00:13:58.530 --> 00:14:01.740
You idiot, they're serious. Stop. Just stop.

00:14:01.740 --> 00:14:03.290
Shut up, let go!

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:04.550
Joe!

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:09.540
Stop it, Joe. Don't make trouble right now.

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:14.000
There's no way we can escape if we keep drawing attention to ourselves.

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:17.910
You understand, right, Joe? Be patient, okay?

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:23.360
Hey, it's already started. Let's go.

00:14:23.360 --> 00:14:25.020
Let's watch, let's watch.

00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:27.530
It's already started. It's started!

00:14:27.530 --> 00:14:30.520
Those two look so serious about it.

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:38.530
Piggies, take bigger shits, okay?

00:14:38.530 --> 00:14:41.900
Hey Fatty, how is it? Are you gonna cry?

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:47.500
No, he's not crying. He's happy because he has finally been reunited with his parents. Am I right?

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:50.500
Your mom is trying to be close to you since she hasn't seen you for so long.

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:52.750
Say "Mommy!"

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:57.010
All right everyone, it's time to start the stabbing game.

00:14:57.010 --> 00:14:58.220
Okay...

00:14:58.220 --> 00:15:00.720
Everyone, watch what I'm doing.

00:15:00.720 --> 00:15:03.640
Praise me if it goes well.

00:15:03.640 --> 00:15:04.720
Here we go!

00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:12.160
And here we go!

00:15:14.150 --> 00:15:15.190
And again!

00:15:18.320 --> 00:15:19.860
What do they think they're doing?

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:21.820
Go, go!

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:24.070
Help me!

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:26.830
Damn it, quiet down, pigs. Damn it.

00:15:26.830 --> 00:15:28.160
Here we go.

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:29.250
Damn it!

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:30.340
Hustle! Come on!

00:15:30.340 --> 00:15:31.250
Hustle! Come on!

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:37.460
Someone help me. It hurts.

00:15:39.210 --> 00:15:40.470
It hurts!

00:15:40.470 --> 00:15:42.470
I'm going to die!

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:44.750
That's it!

00:15:46.220 --> 00:15:48.060
You can ride the pigs.

00:15:48.060 --> 00:15:50.310
Joe, this is our chance!

00:15:50.310 --> 00:15:53.810
You can ride the pigs out!

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:54.980
Ride them out?

00:15:54.980 --> 00:15:55.690
That's right.

00:15:55.690 --> 00:16:01.320
If we drive them mad, they'll burst straight through the gate. I'll help you!

00:16:01.740 --> 00:16:05.740
Really? Okay, we'll use the pigs.

00:16:05.740 --> 00:16:06.730
All right!

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:17.590
What?

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:20.570
Get mad! Get mad!

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:30.750
Serves you right!

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:32.590
Let's go, let's go!

00:16:34.600 --> 00:16:38.150
Nishi, thank you! Let's go.

00:16:39.270 --> 00:16:44.610
Go, go! You guys help him escape too. Let's go!

00:16:45.180 --> 00:16:46.590
What is that?

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:50.410
What's going on? An earthquake?

00:16:56.960 --> 00:17:00.920
No... It's a pig stampede, run!

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:03.530
Go, pigs!

00:17:03.530 --> 00:17:05.070
Go!

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:09.520
Get out of my way!

00:17:10.930 --> 00:17:14.940
Yabuki Joe is coming through. Move, move!

00:17:15.650 --> 00:17:18.100
Isn't that the new guy?

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:19.940
Oh shit, they're coming this way!

00:17:19.940 --> 00:17:23.940
Get out of the way or we'll trample you!

00:17:23.940 --> 00:17:26.450
Run away! Help us!

00:17:30.350 --> 00:17:33.200
We're on our way! This is the climax!

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:36.420
Destroy the gate!

00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:37.250
Let's go!

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:41.250
It's Rikiishi.

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:43.760
Look out! Get out of the way, Rikiishi!

00:17:46.850 --> 00:17:48.920
You'll be crushed. It's too dangerous!

00:17:50.930 --> 00:17:52.930
Move! Get out of my way!

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:02.520
Get away! I don't care if you die.

00:18:15.220 --> 00:18:16.710
Those punches are amazing.

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:23.340
Are you taking a nap with the pigs?

00:18:23.340 --> 00:18:25.940
What's wrong?

00:18:24.250 --> 00:18:25.940
<i>Get up, bro!</i>

00:18:25.940 --> 00:18:28.030
If you'd be so kind...

00:18:28.050 --> 00:18:32.610
Looks like he was trying to "piggyback" his way out of this place.

00:18:32.610 --> 00:18:34.610
Everyone laugh, please.

00:18:41.060 --> 00:18:42.850
Damn it.

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:46.570
Get up. Your game of "escaping prisoner" is over.

00:18:47.440 --> 00:18:48.920
You bastard.

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:52.390
Wait.

00:18:53.990 --> 00:18:59.290
What did I do to you? Why are you getting in my way?

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:04.290
Are you trying to get out with good behavior?

00:19:04.290 --> 00:19:06.980
I'm sorry, but you need to forget about escaping.

00:19:06.980 --> 00:19:10.470
Shut up! Almost... I almost made it! {scream}

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:11.550
Go to hell!

00:19:14.640 --> 00:19:18.310
Stupid kid... he thinks he can beat Rikiishi.

00:19:23.190 --> 00:19:29.030
I've... I've never hated a man more than you in my entire life.

00:19:29.030 --> 00:19:30.420
You bastard!

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:35.650
You're holding back tears. Why are you so upset?

00:19:36.010 --> 00:19:38.850
He's... He's crying!

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:45.540
I'll kill you.

00:19:48.050 --> 00:19:51.170
Don't be stupid. You don't understand who Rikiishi is.

00:19:51.170 --> 00:19:53.440
Someone stop him. It's too dangerous.

00:19:54.340 --> 00:19:57.060
Shut up. I'll do what I want.

00:19:58.240 --> 00:19:59.600
Get ready.

00:20:00.210 --> 00:20:01.600
Prepare yourself.

00:20:02.060 --> 00:20:03.470
Okay.

00:20:08.670 --> 00:20:10.650
H-He connected.

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:22.540
N-No way... Wh-What's happening?

00:20:22.540 --> 00:20:24.440
Aim slightly inside,

00:20:24.440 --> 00:20:26.220
and with a drilling motion...

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:30.700
Punch! Punch! Punch! Punch! Punch! Punch!

00:20:32.350 --> 00:20:35.720
And for the finishing blow, a right upper...

00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:37.720
cut!

00:20:44.980 --> 00:20:46.560
Asshole!

00:20:48.110 --> 00:20:49.980
Such an amateur...

00:20:49.980 --> 00:20:52.610
Damn it. This one will hit.

00:21:05.440 --> 00:21:07.670
How was that? Did it hurt?

00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:13.630
Shit... I'm not done yet.

00:21:13.630 --> 00:21:17.640
O-Oh no... Yabuki is going to get himself killed.

00:21:17.640 --> 00:21:20.770
Rikiishi, please stop, you'll kill him.

00:21:20.770 --> 00:21:22.820
Yabuki, stop it.

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:33.820
What? What's happening?

00:21:35.280 --> 00:21:37.320
N-No good... I can't move.

00:21:37.320 --> 00:21:40.500
I've never felt such a powerful punch before.

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:47.370
He used it... Rikiishi-san's Right Cross Counter.

00:21:53.710 --> 00:21:54.770
Hey.

00:21:54.770 --> 00:21:55.780
Y-Yes?

00:21:55.780 --> 00:22:00.650
Call the guards... and tell them they better get him some help as soon as possible.

00:22:10.520 --> 00:22:12.520
H-He looks like he's dying...

00:22:12.520 --> 00:22:16.900
Yabuki Joe, you really are a strange guy.

00:22:16.900 --> 00:22:19.140
Your first jab was very professional, very strong.

00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:23.460
But your right uppercut was below par.

00:22:23.460 --> 00:22:26.580
I don't get it. Not at all.

00:22:33.980 --> 00:22:35.310
Damn it.

00:22:43.390 --> 00:22:48.000
No... There's no way... Just a little more...

00:22:48.000 --> 00:22:52.500
Just a little more and he would've been out... Just a little...

00:22:52.500 --> 00:22:53.820
Only a little...

00:23:09.810 --> 00:23:11.750
Joe lost.

00:23:11.750 --> 00:23:16.580
The great Rikiishi Toru knocked him out completely.

00:23:17.420 --> 00:23:19.690
Joe can't even stand up.

00:23:19.690 --> 00:23:25.480
Rikiishi, a former pro boxer, had a special punch which shattered Joe's winning streak along with his pride.

00:23:26.900 --> 00:23:30.030
Will he be able to pull himself out of the tightest spot he's ever been in?

00:23:30.700 --> 00:23:34.610
Is Joe going to sell his soul to beat Rikiishi?

00:23:35.430 --> 00:23:40.140
After being completely crushed by Rikiishi Toru,

00:23:40.140 --> 00:23:41.700
where is Joe's tomorrow!?
